(32) Cooperative bank
The term “cooperative bank” means an institution without capital stock organized and operated for mutual purposes and without profit, which—
    (A) is subject by law to supervision and examination by State or Federal authority having supervision over such institutions, and
    (B) meets the requirements of subparagraphs (B) and (C) of paragraph (19) of this subsection (relating to definition of domestic building and loan association).
In determining whether an institution meets the requirements referred to in subparagraph (B) of this paragraph, any reference to an association or to a domestic building and loan association contained in paragraph (19) shall be deemed to be a reference to such institution.

§19 defines domestic building and loan association with conditions A, B, C.
§32 says cooperative bank — a specific type of institution — also qualifies under §19's B and C conditions, with the substitution that wherever §19 says "association" read "cooperative bank" instead.
So §32 is a subtype declaration. Cooperative bank is a subtype of the §19 entity class, satisfying the same asset and business conditions, just with a different organizational form — no capital stock, mutual purposes, nonprofit.
The formalization consequence is that IsCooperativeBank doesn't need to reimplement §19's B and C conditions. It calls IsDomesticBuildingAndLoan with a substitution — pass the cooperative bank where the scope expects an association.
However, this requies going back anc adding one more type to the BuildingAndLoanType or the associations that are considered (the enums don't hole cooperative bank as a type which needs to be fixed.)

```catala-metadata
declaration scope IsCooperativeBank:

    # narrowing conditions on institutions
    input no_capital_stock content boolean
    input mutual_purposes content boolean
    input nonprofit content boolean

    # extra inputs required to determine domestic building per a(19)
    input output association_type content A_19.BuildingAndLoanType
    input subject_to_supervision content boolean
    input business_is_savings_and_loans content boolean
    input total_assets_at_close_of_taxable_year content money
    input qualifying_assets_at_close_of_taxable_year content list of A_19.Asset
    output is_cooperative_bank content boolean

scope IsCooperativeBank:
    definition is_cooperative_bank equals
    no_capital_stock
    and mutual_purposes
    and nonprofit 
    and subject_to_supervision
    and (output of A_19.DetermineDomesticBuildingAndLoan with {
            -- association_type: association_type
            -- subject_to_supervision: subject_to_supervision
            -- business_is_savings_and_loans: business_is_savings_and_loans
            -- total_assets_at_close_of_taxable_year: total_assets_at_close_of_taxable_year
            -- qualifying_assets_at_close_of_taxable_year: qualifying_assets_at_close_of_taxable_year
        }).is_domestic_building_and_loan
```
